    {
      "Original": "Where am I again? - Settings",
      "Context": "ConfigurationWindow..ctor",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ 窗口标题",
      "Translated": "我在哪里？设置",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Use the text box below to define how you want the text to be formatted.\nUse symbols {0} {1} {2} {3} {4} where you want the following values to be in the string\n\n{0} - Region (Ex. The Northern Empty)\n{1} - Territory (Ex. Old Sharlayan)\n{2} - Area (Ex. Archons Design)\n{3} - Sub-Area (Ex. Old Sharlayan Aetheryte Plaza)\n{4} - Housing Ward (Ex. Ward 14)",
      "Context": "ConfigurationWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "在下方文本框中设置位置的显示格式。\n用 {0} {1} {2} {3} {4} 指定以下信息的显示位置。\n\n{0} - 大区（例：北洋地域）\n{1} - 区域（例：旧萨雷安）\n{2} - 地区（例：七贤人庭园）\n{3} - 小区域（例：以太之光广场）\n{4} - 住宅区（例：第 14 区）",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Show Instance Number",
      "Context": "ConfigurationWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "显示副本区编号",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Shows the instance number for the current instance at the end of the string",
